{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/issues/1247","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/issues/1247/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/issues/1247/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/issues/1247/events","html_url":"https://github.com/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/issues/1247","id":6269100193,"node_id":"I_kwDORhCjFc8AAAABdargoQ","number":1247,"title":"Close retirement and operation bindings in the private campaign crosswalk validator","user":{"login":"realmarcin","id":4625870,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2MjU4NzA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4625870?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin","html_url":"https://github.com/realmarcin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2026-11-08T08:24:40Z","updated_at":"2026-11-08T09:09:15Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Independent review of the private full-campaign accounting scaffold confirmed a bounded producer-integrity defect before its future resolution helper is used.\n\n`validate_resolution_crosswalk` in `.temp/all-unmatched-20261107/integration/final-application-accounting-v1/accounting.py` (SHA256 `aaf9cec9e8db56e60c90de5517361799a33516f3f0e0a8dcc922d36af008c5a4`, line309) returns `structurally_complete: true` for six reproduced invalid inputs: an unknown retirement successor; self-retirement; a retirement cycle; duplicate origin denominator entries; conflicting payloads sharing one operation; and a malformed payload digest. Nonempty receipt strings suffice without the declared successor/operation verification.\n\nThis helper is not called by the frozen builder. The current frozen accounting remains correct: all1,879cases,985proposalorigins,947declaredpathgroups,33unresolveddivergentgroups and zero application-eligible targets. No actual retirement error, native gate bypass, scientific approval or maintained write was established.\n\nBefore real use, validate the unique origin universe; close retirements over explicit verified published successors; reject self/cyclic supersession; validate digests and consistent operation bindings; and bind real evidence/native-verification references. Alternatively, explicitly restrict this helper to syntax-only checking and require the absent verification elsewhere. Preserve original tests/reports and add all reproduced negative controls, without widening any native or scientific gate.\n\nFinding `W01-SCAFFOLD-STRUCT-001`, reproduction script and exact six input/output fixtures are in `.temp/all-unmatched-20261107/workers/w01/worktree/.temp/campaign-accounting-scaffold-independent-v1/`. Review manifest SHA256 `d61ece1caf69a4af812e93fef31a23f18e61899da6a42906d8e86123df3b8b17` (120 regular members and2fixture symlinks checked by coordinator). The original35controls pass;27additional probes were run by an independent skeptical reviewer. No fix has been made. This issue concerns the private future helper, not a claim that existing canonical mappings or native receipt gates are broken.\n","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/issues/1247/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/issues/1247/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}